    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – Ordering Milk",
      "",
      "November 30, 2019 Very sunny",
      "",
      "Today, I went to drink something with Lili. Lili wanted to drink milk, I also wanted to drink milk.",
      "",
      "I said: “Waiter, I want two milk!”",
      "",
      "Everyone around us looked at me laughing. I didn’t know what they were laughing about.",
      "",
      "Lili also laughed. She said that “two milk” means “mistress” in Chinese.",
      "",
      "Heavens! I said “I want two milk!”, and everyone around us thought “I want a mistress”!",
      "",
      "Heavens! So humiliating! I just wanted to say “Waiter, I want two glasses of milk”…",
      "",
      "Chinese really is very difficult!",
      ""
    ]
  }
